notes.content:
This major update adds the "Challenges" mode to the game. Here's something about it:
[list]
[*] The mode so far includes three missions, which become available after completing chapters 1, 2, and 4 of the main story;
[*] The missions take place in familiar locations, but have many changes and limitations (for example, on one of them you have to rob a mansion without breaking a single lock);
[*] Each mission has an additional goal, for the completion of which is the reward. It can be obtained in the main plot of the game (in the closet in Jack's house). For example, one of these rewards is the "Bag of Ashes", we think you can guess its purpose without a description;
[*] Added 3 new achievements.
[/list]
